{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794372325351,"sessionID":"ses_e371ecd85ffetuxErfgozmd2zb","part":{"id":"prt_1c8eccfb6001TiOw33QbIMq56i","messageID":"msg_1c8ec8c57001kIGqDKslDF50zS","sessionID":"ses_e371ecd85ffetuxErfgozmd2zb","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794372325351,"sessionID":"ses_e371ecd85ffetuxErfgozmd2zb","part":{"id":"prt_1c8eccfb9001LuN81aLaYOjl2G","messageID":"msg_1c8ec8c57001kIGqDKslDF50zS","sessionID":"ses_e371ecd85ffetuxErfgozmd2zb","type":"text","text":"Implemented the full sensor dashboard.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`)\n- SQLite storage in `./data/dashboard.db` with users, bearer tokens, sensors, and readings (cascading deletes).\n- Endpoints: health, register/login, sensor CRUD with owner checks (401/403), readings listing with `total`/`limit`, and posting readings that updates `last_value`/`last_updated`.\n- Serves the built frontend with SPA fallback; JSON 404s for unknown `/api` routes.\n- Hashed passwords, server-set timestamps, WAL mode, safe parameterized queries.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/`)\n- React + TypeScript + Vite, Tailwind v4 (only Tailwind entry CSS).\n- Auth context with persistent token, register/sign-in pages, username + sign-out in header.\n- Dashboard with sensor cards (latest value, unit, location, relative update time), 10s auto-refresh, filter, create-sensor and post-reading forms, delete with confirmation.\n- Sensor detail page with Recharts line chart, stats, readings table, and owner-only reading/delete controls.\n\n**Verified**\n- API test suite passed (auth, ownership, sorting, limits, cascade deletes, persistence across restart).\n- `npm run typecheck`, `npm run build`, and `npm ci` builds cleanly.\n- Updated `requirements.lock` to a consistent pinned set and added `.gitignore`.","time":{"start":1794372325305,"end":1794372325310}}}
